  "content_id": "16136241",
  "title": "Polygon POL Network Fees",
  "description": "POL Polygon (Matic) Network – Ultra-Cheap and Fast\nPolygon is a highly popular Ethereum-compatible network with extremely low fees and ver...",
  "body": "<h1 id=\"h_01JSZ1HY8S77AK3QTH3QFX95BJ\">POL Polygon (Matic) Network – Ultra-Cheap and Fast</h1><p class=\"no-margin\">Polygon is a highly popular Ethereum-compatible network with extremely low fees and very fast block times.</p><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ1HY8SQ7CAPAA7R15N9PRC\">How Polygon Fees Work</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Gas price (in gwei)</b></p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Network congestion</b></p></li></ul><p class=\"no-margin\">Fees are still paid in MATIC token but are much cheaper than Ethereum.</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ1HY8S6GA26QRQP18BHKT3\">Fee Options Available</h2><ul><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>High</b> – Fastest confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Optimal (default)</b> – Smart middle ground</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Low</b> – Cheapest, slow confirmation</p></li><li><p class=\"no-margin\"><b>Custom</b> – Full control over gas settings</p></li></ul><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ1HY8ST5EFD3EHGV6MPXJ9\">Average Cost</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Typically around <b>$0.002 to $0.01 USD</b> per transaction — fractions of a cent!</p><hr><h2 id=\"h_01JSZ1HY8SXGM54Z9R4ZC9SXWV\">Why It Matters</h2><p class=\"no-margin\">Polygon is perfect for cheap everyday use, gaming, NFTs, and DeFi. Edge Wallet simplifies picking the right fee so you stay fast without overpaying.</p>",
